    G[("Guest")] --- UC1 & UC2 & UC3 & UC4 & UC5 & UC6
    U[("User")] --- UC7 & UC8 & UC9 & UC10 & UC11 & UC12 & UC13
    P[("Publisher")] --- UC14 & UC15 & UC16 & UC17 & UC18 & UC19 & UC20
    SP[("Service Provider")] --- UC21 & UC22 & UC23 & UC24
    A[("Admin")] --- UC25 & UC26 & UC27 & UC28 & UC29 & UC30 & UC31

    St[("Stripe")] --> UC12
    Push[("FCM / Pusher")] --> UC10

    U -. inherits .-> G
    P -. inherits .-> U
    SP -. inherits .-> U
